where the Argo was sunk. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}\n\n[[Category:Vehicles]]\n[[Category:Artifacts]]\n[[Category:Watercraft]]\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Stavropolous River]]","text":"On their mission, Jason and the Argonauts, Dante's team hoped to track down the Argo and recover Jason's Titans, the Hoplites. After travelling to the Stavropolous River in Velo, Greece, the team dived down a shipwreck that they believed to be the Argo. However, after arduously working to bring the ship to the surface, they learned that the ship belonged to Atalanta. The hull of the ship did however provide a map detailing where the Argo was sunk. [The Treasures of the Argonauts]"}],"full_text":"Atalanta's ship was a ship currently wrecked next to the Stavropolous River that belonged to Atalanta, one of the argonauts. It was initially mistaken by the Huntik team to be the Argo.\n\n== History ==\nOn their mission, Jason and the Argonauts, Dante's team hoped to track down the Argo and recover Jason's Titans, the Hoplites. After travelling to the Stavropolous River in Velo, Greece, the team dived down a shipwreck that they believed to be the Argo. However, after arduously working to bring the ship to the surface, they learned that the ship belonged to Atalanta. The hull of the ship did however provide a map detailing where the Argo was sunk. [The Treasures of the Argonauts]","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox location|name=Atalanta's Ship|image=Atalanta's Ship.png|type=Shipwreck|location = [[Stavropolous River]]<br>[[Velo, Greece]]\n|artifacts=Atalanta's Map|former=[[Atalanta]] †|first=\"[[The Treasures of the Argonauts]]\"}}\n'''Atalanta's ship''' was a ship currently wrecked next to the [[Stavropolous River]] that belonged to [[Atalanta]], one of the argonauts. It was initially mistaken by the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik]] team to be the [[Argo]].\n\n== History ==\nOn their mission, [[Jason and the Argonauts]], Dante's team hoped to track down the Argo and recover Jason's [[Titans]], the [[Hoplite]]s. After travelling to the [[Stavropolous River]] in [[Velo, Greece]], the team dived down a shipwreck that they believed to be the Argo. However, after arduously working to bring the ship to the surface, they learned that the ship belonged to [[Atalanta]]. The hull of the ship did however provide a map detailing where the Argo was sunk. {{source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}\n\n[[Category:Vehicles]]\n[[Category:Artifacts]]\n[[Category:Watercraft]]\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Stavropolous River]]","categories":["Artifacts","Locations","Stavropolous River","Vehicles","Watercraft"],"links":[{"target_title":"Stavropolous River","label":"Stavropolous River","target_id":"huntik:page:19620","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Stavropolous_River","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A19620"},{"target_title":"Velo, Greece","label":"Velo, Greece","target_id":"huntik:page:17589","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Velo%2C_Greece","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Velo%2C%20Greece"},{"target_title":"Atalanta","label":"Atalanta","target_id":"huntik:page:19646","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Atalanta","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A19646"},{"target_title":"The Treasures of the Argonauts","label":"The Treasures of the Argonauts","target_id":"huntik:page:3366","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Treasures_of_the_Argonauts","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3366"},{"target_title":"Stavropolous River","label":"Stavropolous River","target_id":"huntik:page:19620","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Stavropolous_River","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A19620"},{"target_title":"Atalanta","label":"Atalanta","target_id":"huntik:page:19646","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Atalanta","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A19646"},{"target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik","target_id":"